WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:05.840
Larry P. Arnn:
The government is the necessary solution to

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.470
a problem, and that is us.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.139
Lord knows what we might do without laws.

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:16.129
There's a problem with government.

00:00:16.129 --> 00:00:20.330
That's us too.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.089
First of all, the name means something cool.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:28.390
It means to set a thing up firmly in place.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:30.669
It's actually like the word for statue.

00:00:30.669 --> 00:00:33.520
Just think of this particular problem.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:38.510
If you're going to have more than one person
make the law, you're going to have to have

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:44.960
a constitution to describe how that's done,
or else you're going to have wars all the

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.170
time about who gets to make the law.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:51.750
The problem with government, the government
is a solution to a problem.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:57.190
The necessary solution to a problem, and that
is us.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:02.670
There's a problem with government, that's
us too.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:08.460
Madison wrote, "What is government but the
profoundest of all commentaries on human nature.

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.979
If men were angels, no government would be
needed.

00:01:11.979 --> 00:01:17.360
If angels were to govern men, neither internal
nor external controls on the government would

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:19.139
be necessary."

00:01:19.139 --> 00:01:26.609
Since it's true that both the thing that needs
protecting and the danger to it are the same

00:01:26.609 --> 00:01:34.209
thing, then you have to have some method of
both assembling and granting power, and of

00:01:34.209 --> 00:01:36.579
restraining power.

00:01:36.579 --> 00:01:42.130
Our constitution is the best at that in all
of history, and the explanations of it by

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:49.759
the people who wrote it are the most profound
explanations of that kind in all of human

00:01:49.759 --> 00:01:51.779
history.

